{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Untamed Lust</i> is an adult-only visual novel for players 18 and older. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose to play as one of three characters:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Axel</strong>, a ruthless and domineering army commander. Arrogant and power-hungry, he uses his position and raw charisma to seduce the women under his command, including nurses and secretaries. As his sexual exploits escalate, Axel\u2019s secret affairs turn into a dangerous game of public power plays, performed in front of his soldiers to prove his alpha male status.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946370/extras/60536ed621c5b4298e15502346103735.poster.avif?t=1768675520\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946370/extras/60536ed621c5b4298e15502346103735.webm?t=1768675520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Isabella</strong>, a strong-willed and beautiful dancer, who is on the verge of leaving her weak-willed boyfriend, Cody.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946370/extras/c42dacea537b8493904849cf98fa3ca6.poster.avif?t=1768675520\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946370/extras/c42dacea537b8493904849cf98fa3ca6.webm?t=1768675520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Cody</strong>, Isabella's conflicted boyfriend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As word of his misconduct spreads, officials launch a secret operation to arrest him. Axel, however, is one step ahead. With the help of one of his lovers, he manages to escape and flees to a remote, untamed forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946370/extras/8d7ca9b322faeef075126eb88c8cb67d.poster.avif?t=1768675520\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946370/extras/8d7ca9b322faeef075126eb88c8cb67d.webm?t=1768675520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, a group of young friends ventures into the same wilderness. Isabella and Cody are joined by their friends Valerie and the effeminate Tobey, an LGBTQ character. They are unaware of the fugitive commander now living in the depths of the forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the forest, the paths of Axel and the four friends collide. <i>Untamed Lust</i> is a story of survival and sexuality, with multiple branching paths and outcomes. The choices you make will determine the fate of these characters and lead to a variety of intimate encounters, including LGBTQ scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each choice offers a unique journey through a tale of desire, betrayal, and untamed lust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946370/extras/886da01bf2059ae4facfac412bb95fd5.poster.avif?t=1768675520\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946370/extras/886da01bf2059ae4facfac412bb95fd5.webm?t=1768675520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3946370?t=1768675520","background_raw":"https://stor