r friends collide. <i>Untamed Lust</i> is a story of survival and sexuality, with multiple branching paths and outcomes. The choices you make will determine the fate of these characters and lead to a variety of intimate encounters, including LGBTQ scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each choice offers a unique journey through a tale of desire, betrayal, and untamed lust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946370/extras/886da01bf2059ae4facfac412bb95fd5.poster.avif?t=1768675520\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946370/extras/886da01bf2059ae4facfac412bb95fd5.webm?t=1768675520\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Kinetic Play"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946370/59a9bb4920e191432264b2a773e9555749526579/header.jpg?t=1768675520","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04+, SteamOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz Dual-Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.0 compatible graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> ALSA or PulseAudio compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requires 64-bit processor and operating system.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04+, SteamOS 3.x<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 3.0 GHz Quad-Core CPU or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong